      "mulaIast": "nanu evaṃ darpaṇe mukhasyābhāve upādheḥ pratibimbapakṣapātitvena mukhapratimukhayoravadātatvaśyāmatvavat jīvabrahmaṇoḥ saṃsāritvāsaṃsāritvādivyavasthā kathamiti cet, na | āropitenādarśasthatvena viśiṣṭe pratibimbe taddharmasya mālinyādeḥ sambhavāt | na ca upādhisthatvasyāpi āropyatvena kathaṃ mālinyāśrayatāvacchedakatvam ? ekaviśiṣṭe itarāropābhāvāditi vācyam, āropapūrvapratītadharmaviśiṣṭasyaivāropyāśrayatvāt, na tu tasya satyatvamapīti paraprakriyānibandhanadoṣānavakāśāt | na ca pratimukhameva darpaṇasthaṃ na tu mukhamiti pratibimbadarpaṇasthatvānubhavena kathaṃ pratibimbatvasya tatsthatvagarmateti vācyam, avidyopahitasyāvidyāśrayatvavat darpaṇopahitasya darpaṇāśritvasaṃbhavāt | etena mālinyasthānīyasya saṃsārasya viśiṣṭavṛttitvāt śuddhāśritamokṣasāmānādhikaraṇyāyoga iti nirastam | saṃsārastāvadupahitavṛttiḥ, tathā copadheyāṃśamādāya sāmānādhikaraṇyasaṃbhavāt | tathā ca vṛkṣasthakapisaṃyogādhāratā agreṇeva mukhemālinyaṃ darpaṇasambandhenāvacchidyate | etāvāneva viśeṣaḥ vṛkṣe kapisaṃyogastu sāhajikaḥ, mukhe aupādhikaṃ mālinyam | tenopahite upādhyavacchinna eva mukhe mālinyadhīḥ, etena darpaṇamālinyasya mukhaniṣṭhatve saṃsārasyāpi śuddhaniṣṭhatāpattiḥ, vṛkṣaḥ saṃyukta iti vat mukhaṃ malinamiti pratītyāpattiḥ, makhaṃ na malinam kintu pratimukhamityanubhavavirodhāpattiśceti nirastam | nanu kastūryādipratibimbasya svalakṣaṇānanugamena kathaṃ bimbaikyam ? na ca tadākāratāmātreṇa tattvaṃ, tarhi chāyāpratimudrāpratimādīnāmapi tattvaṃ syāt, pratyaṅmukhatvāderbhedakasyātrāpi sattvācca | na ca pratyaṅmukhatvadhīrbhrāntā, pratibimbaṃ bimbābhimukhaṃ neti kadāpyananubhavāditi cenna, darpaṇādipratibimbe svalakṣaṇānugamena bimbaikye vyavasthite pratibimbatvāvacchedenaiva tatkalpanād, chāyādau svalakṣaṇakatvasya kutrāpyadarśanena sāmyābhāvāt | nāpi pratyaṅmukhatvādi bhedakam, malinatvavadupādhikṛtatvāt | ata eva japākusume raktatāpratītivat taddhīrbhrāntā | darpaṇāhataṃ cakṣuḥ pratyaṅmukhaṃ bhavati, tasya ca svābhimukhatayā grahaṇasāmarthyāccānyābhimukhasyāpi mukhādestathāgrahaṇopapatteśca | taduktaṃ-\n\"darpaṇābhihatā dṛṣṭiḥ parāvṛttya svamānanam |\nvyāpnuvantyābhimukhyena vyatyastaṃ daśayenmukham ||\"\n\nna ca parāvṛttya svamukhasyaiva grahaṇe pārśvasthasya mukhadvayapratītyayogaḥ, svamukhasyaiveti niyamāsiddheḥ, upādhisannihitamātrasyaiva tathā grahaṇāt | na ca evaṃ darpaṇāderabhighātakatāmātreṇa upakṣīṇatayā darpaṇa iva darpaṇabhede'pyanekamukhapratītirna syāditi vācyam, abhighātakānekatvena cakṣuṣo'nekāgrasampattyā pratyagraṃ svābhighātakāvacchedakamukhagrāhakatayā dṛṣṭāntavaiṣamyāt | na ca maṇidarpaṇakṛpāṇādiṣu viruddharūpānekamukhapratītiḥ kathamevaṃ yujyata iti vācyam, anvayavyatirekasiddhopādhi- prābalyanibandhanatvāditi gṛhāṇa | na ca cakṣuḥ parivṛttiprakriyā brahmapratibimbe jīve na saṃbhavatīti vācyam, cākṣuṣapratibimbamātraviṣayatayaivāsyā upapāditatvāt | na ca viralāvayasya jalasya netrābhighātakatve jalāntargataśilādyagrahaṇaprasaṅgaḥ, sarvāvacchedenābhighātābhāvenāntare'pi cakṣuṣaḥ praveśasaṃbhavāt | na ca evaṃ bahudūravyavahitordhvabhāgasūryādigrahaṇe pṛṣṭhabhāgasthasya vyavahitasyāpi grahaṇāpattiriti vācyam cakṣuṣo gamanāgamanābhyāṃ viśeṣāt | na hi dūrasthasūryagrahaṇaṃ vadatā pṛṣṭhakuḍyādikaṃ bhittvā cakṣurgacchatītyuktaṃ bhavati | na ca evaṃ śilābhihatamapi cakṣuḥ parāvṛttya mukhaṃ gṛhṇātviti vācyam | tavāpi pratibimbaṃ tatrotpadyatāmityāpatteḥ, asvacchatayā parihārasyāsmākamapi samatvam | tava svaccha eva utpadyate, mama tata eva cakṣuḥ parāvartate ityaṅgīkārāt | na caivaṃ pratibimbadarśanenāpi bimbadarśanajanyasukhapuṇyādiprasaṅgaḥ, yatra taddarśanamātrajanyatā nānyataḥ, tatreṣṭāpatteḥ yatra copādhivinirmuktajñānatvena viśiṣya janyatā, tatrāpādakābhāvāt | nacaivaṃ sūryakasyāpi sūryavad durdarśatvāpattiḥ, golake sūryatejaḥsāmmukhyasya durdarśatāprayojakasya sūryakagrahaṇakāle'bhāvāt | na ca svacchadarpaṇa kiñcitsvacchatāmrādau mukhasaṃsthānaviśeṣapratītyāpātaḥ, upādhigatātyantasvacchatāvyatirekaprayojakamālinyādereva tatra pratibandhakatvād, anyathā tavāpi tādṛksaṃsthānaviśeṣavat pratibimbaṃ tatra kathaṃ notpadyata ityasya duṣpariharatvāpatteḥ |\n\nnanu avacchedapakṣe dviguṇīkṛtya vṛttyasambhave'pi pratibimbapakṣe tatsaṃbhavenāntaryāmitvamiti svavacanavirodhaḥ, upādheḥ pratibimbapakṣapātitvamityuktyayogaśceti cenna, sarvopādhyavacchinnatvaikadeśopādhyavacchinnatvābhyāmupādhikalpitabhedena ca svoktyavirodhopapatteḥ | ata eva darpaṇe na mukhamityeva upādhisaṃsṛṣṭatayā niṣidhyate, na tu `nedaṃ rūpya'mitivat naitanmukhamiti svarūpeṇa | nanu nātra mukhacchāyāstītyananubhavena pratyutaitāvantaṃ kālam atra pratisūrya āsīditivat pratimukhamāsīdityevānubhavena pratibimbamivādarśa ityādismṛtyā vā pratimukhe darpaṇasthatvasyāpyabādha eva, na hi bhūmau megho netyetāvatā meghacchāyāpi tatra bādhiteti - cenna, mukhapratimukhayorekasvalakṣaṇakatvenaikyavyavasthityā mukhasyaiva tatsthatvaniṣedhena pratimukhasya tatsattvaniṣedhasaṃbhavāt | meghacchāyāpratisūryādīnāṃ na tatheti na meghādiniṣedhena chāyādiniṣedhaḥ | smṛtistu prātītikārthamādāya dṛṣṭāntaparā | na ca evaṃ pratibambād bimbānumānocchedaḥ sādhyāviśeṣāditi vācyam, upādhikalpitabhedena viśeṣopapatteḥ | etena `nekṣetodyantamāditya'mityanena udyatpratibimbadarśanasyāpi niṣedhaḥ syāt, vāristha sūryadarśananiṣedhenākāśasthasūryadarśanasyāpi niṣedhaśca syāt, pratibimbadarśanenaiva dṛṣṭvā snāyāditi śāstrārtho'pyanuṣṭhitaḥ syāditi nirastam, kalpitabhedādeva śāstrīyavyavasthopapatteḥ na ca audumbaratayā jñātenānaudumbareṇa audumbaro yūpo bhavatīti śāstrārthasiddhiprasaṅgaḥ, ātmatayā jñātadehaśravaṇādinātmā śrotavya iti śāstrārthasiddhiprasaṅgaśceti vācyam, pramayā upapattau saṃbhavantyāṃ bhrameṇa tadupapādanasyāyuktatvāt | nanu anāderjīvasya nopādhyadhīnaṃ pratibimbatvam, kintu tadadhīnatve sati tatsadṛśatvam, tacca bhedavyāptamiti viruddho hetuḥ | uktaṃ hi sūtrakṛtā- `ata eva copamā sūryakādiva'diti cet, na, upādhyadhīnatvaṃ hi upādhau satyeva sattvam | tacca nānāditvavirodhi, anādijīvasyāpi tatsaṃbhavāt | ata eva pratibimbapadasya bhedasādṛśyārthakatvamādāya viruddhatvoktirhetāvayuktā | tadevam-\npratibimbasya bimbenaikye vyavasthite |\nbrahmaikyaṃ jīvajātasya siddhaṃ tatpratibimbanāt ||\nityadvaitasiddhau bimbapratibimbanyāyenaikyasiddhiḥ || 32 ||"
